Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(web):=20kiyintirish=20=E2=80=94=20"Ma'lumot?=
 =?UTF-8?q?lar=20to'liq=20emas"=20xatosi?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Skanerlashdan keyin avatar yasash so'rovi silentsiz 400 bilan yiqilardi
va ekranda umumiy «Ma'lumotlar to'liq emas» chiqardi, sabab hech qayerda
ko'rinmasdi.

Sabab: requestAvatar POST'ni body'siz yuborardi -> Content-Type ham
qo'yilmasdi -> express.json() tanani parse qilmasdi -> req.body
undefined -> route zod «obyekt kutgandim, undefined keldi» deb yiqilardi
-> ApiError.validation([]) default xabari qaytardi.

Tuzatma: body: {} ni qo'shish. Route sxemasi (.partial()) bo'sh obyektni
qabul qiladi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/web/src/api/endpoints.ts | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/apps/web/src/api/endpoints.ts b/apps/web/src/api/endpoints.ts
index a107cb9..6b9b8ab 100644
--- a/apps/web/src/api/endpoints.ts
+++ b/apps/web/src/api/endpoints.ts
@@ -529,7 +529,15 @@ export const getAvatar = (options: ApiOptions = {}): Promise<UserAvatar> =>
   api<UserAvatar>('/tryon/avatar', options);
 
 export const requestAvatar = (options: ApiOptions = {}): Promise<UserAvatar> =>
-  api<UserAvatar>('/tryon/avatar', { ...options, method: 'POST' });
+  /*
+   * ⚠️ `body: {}` SHART. `requestAvatar` o'lchov/do'kon talab qilmaydi, lekin
+   * backend route zod sxemasi (`z.object(...).partial()`) BOSH OBYEKT kutadi.
+   * Bo'sh POST yuborilsa `Content-Type` ham qo'yilmaydi va `express.json()`
+   * tanani parse qilmaydi: `req.body === undefined`, zod esa «obyekt kutgandim,
+   * `undefined` keldi» deydi va umumiy «Ma`lumotlar to`liq emas» qaytadi —
+   * foydalanuvchi uchun hech qanday ma'lumot bermaydigan xato.
+   */
+  api<UserAvatar>('/tryon/avatar', { ...options, method: 'POST', body: {} });
 
 export const requestAvatarAngle = (
   angle: AvatarAngle,
